# systemd-tmpfiles rules for news-bot.
# Installed to /etc/tmpfiles.d/news-bot.conf; applied with `systemd-tmpfiles --create`.
# See tmpfiles.d(5).
#
# Columns: Type  Path                Mode  User     Group    Age  Argument
#   z = adjust mode/owner of an existing path (non-recursive); does NOT create it.
#       (Z = recursive, d = create dir, f = create file — not needed here.)
# Keep the secrets file locked down to the service account.
z  /opt/news-bot/.env  0640  newsbot  newsbot  -
